---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Psychiatric Services | Mind Menders | Towson, MD"
  description="Comprehensive psychiatric services from Matthew Mauro, PMHNP-BC. ADHD, anxiety, depression, autism, PTSD, bipolar, schizophrenia, and more. Medication management and therapy in Towson, MD."
  activeNav="services"
>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>Services</span></nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-white">What We Treat</span>
    <h1>Comprehensive Psychiatric Services</h1>
    <p>Expert diagnosis, medication management, and evidence-based therapy for children, adolescents, and adults in Towson, MD and via telehealth throughout Maryland.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center"><span class="eyebrow">Conditions</span><h2>Areas of Specialization</h2></div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <a href="/adhd" class="service-card service-card-featured">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#129504;</div><h3>ADHD &mdash; All Ages</h3>
        <p>Comprehensive evaluation and evidence-based medication management for attention deficit hyperactivity disorder. From diagnosis through ongoing care, we help patients of every age thrive.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/autism" class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#129490;</div><h3>Autism Spectrum Disorder</h3>
        <p>Specialized psychiatric support addressing co-occurring conditions and behavioral challenges in autism spectrum disorder across the lifespan.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/depression" class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#127774;</div><h3>Depression</h3>
        <p>Evidence-based treatment for major depressive disorder and persistent depressive disorder. Restoring emotional balance and building resilience.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/anxiety" class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#128153;</div><h3>Anxiety Disorders</h3>
        <p>Generalized anxiety disorder, social anxiety, panic disorder, and related conditions. Targeted care that helps you reclaim daily life.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/ptsd-ocd" class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#128737;</div><h3>PTSD &amp; OCD</h3>
        <p>Specialized trauma-informed care for post-traumatic stress disorder and obsessive-compulsive disorder using proven therapeutic approaches.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/bipolar" class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#9878;</div><h3>Bipolar Disorder</h3>
        <p>Careful mood stabilization and ongoing management for bipolar I, bipolar II, and cyclothymia. Expertise and genuine compassion.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/schizophrenia" class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#128161;</div><h3>Schizophrenia &amp; Thought Disorders</h3>
        <p>Expert evaluation and medication management for schizophrenia, schizoaffective disorder, delusional disorder, and other thought disorders. Stability and compassion for patients and families.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/mood-disorders" class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon-wrap">&#127774;</div><h3>Mood Disorders</h3>
        <p>Comprehensive care for the full spectrum of mood disorders, including dysthymia, cyclothymia, and adjustment disorders with depressed mood.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more &#8594;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center"><span class="eyebrow">Therapeutic Approaches</span><h2>More Than Medication</h2><p class="lead">Matthew combines psychiatric medication management with evidence-based therapy approaches personalized to each patient.</p></div>
    <div class="therapy-grid">
      <div class="therapy-card"><div class="therapy-icon">&#128172;</div><h3>Talk Therapy</h3><p>A safe, confidential space to explore your thoughts and feelings. Builds self-awareness and develops healthy coping skills.</p></div>
      <div class="therapy-card"><div class="therapy-icon">&#129504;</div><h3>Cognitive Behavioral Therapy</h3><p>Structured, goal-oriented therapy to identify and reframe negative thought patterns. Highly effective for anxiety, depression, and OCD.</p></div>
      <div class="therapy-card"><div class="therapy-icon">&#128149;</div><h3>Trauma-Informed Care</h3><p>Every clinical interaction prioritizes safety, trust, and patient autonomy &mdash; essential foundations for effective psychiatric healing.</p></div>
      <div class="therapy-card"><div class="therapy-icon">&#128138;</div><h3>Medication Management</h3><p>Careful prescribing, thorough monitoring, and ongoing adjustments. Evidence-based pharmacotherapy as part of a comprehensive plan.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
    <p>New patients welcome. Call or reach out to schedule your first appointment &mdash; in-person in Towson or via telehealth statewide.</p>
    <div class="cta-phone"><a href="tel:4437987707">(443) 798-7707</a></div>
    <div class="cta-actions"><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Schedule Appointment</a><a href="/telehealth" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-lg">Learn About Telehealth</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
